SUMMARY:Fusion: 4th Metabolism in Health & Disease 2026
LOCATION:Dolce CampoReal Lisboa\, Torres Vedras\, Portugal
DESCRIPTION:Fourth edition of the Fusion Conferences residential meeting on
  metabolism in aging\, physiology and disease. Sessions cover developmenta
 l and stem cell metabolism\, aging metabolism\, systemic metabolism in hea
 lth and disease\, organellar metabolism\, metabolic drug discovery and die
 tary interventions\, technology development\, computational and AI-based a
 pproaches\, and metabolites as signalling molecules.\n\nWhy it matters for
  mTOR (★): mTOR is not billed anywhere in the programme\, which is organ
 ised around mitochondria\, lipids\, metabolites and metabolic proteomics. 
 The relevance comes from the speaker list rather than from the announced c
 ontent: Brian K. Kennedy\, who has three studies in the Atlas\, speaks on 
 'Maximising healthspan – interventions and clocks'\, and Christina Tower
 s on leveraging autophagy in pancreatic cancer. The 'aging metabolism' and
  'metabolic drug discovery and dietary interventions' sessions sit next to
  the nutrient-sensing question without naming it.\n\nSpeakers or organiser
 s with a profile in the Atlas: Brian K. Kennedy\n\nConference site: https:
 //fusion-conferences.com/conference/205\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https:/
 /mtor-atlas.org/events/#ev-fusion-4th-metabolism-in-health-disease-2026
